# iOS shell

Follow [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md):

- WebView is edge-to-edge (`contentInset: never`, StatusBar overlays). CSS `env(safe-area-inset-*)` via `--sat` / `--sab` owns insets.
- Status bar style by path: `syncStatusBarForPath` in `src/lib/native.ts` (light icons on `/`, dark elsewhere).
- Sheets/toasts must clear island and home indicator.
- Before Xcode/TestFlight: `npm run ios:sync`. Run the TestFlight QA list in AGENTS.md after chrome changes.
